%description:
Tests TS.Recent from the handshake (RFC 7323 appendix D). The client opens at
t=0.5 s, so its SYN carries TSval 500. The server saves it in LISTEN, and its
SYN-ACK echoes TSecr 500. The client saves the TSval 502 of the SYN-ACK in
SYN_SENT, and the ACK that completes the handshake and the first data segment
echo TSecr 502.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.tOpen=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 100"
*.*_tcp.timestampSupport = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A001] A.1000 > B.2000: S 125000:125000(0) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP TS(500,0)
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B001] A.1000 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP TS(502,500)
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.505 A002] A.1000 > B.2000: A ack 125501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(504,502)
srv_tcp: SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_ACK)
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 125001:125101(100) ack 125501 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1000,502)
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 125101 win 16384   Option(s): NOP NOP TS(1202,1000)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
Setting ts_recent from the handshake segment: ts_recent=500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
